A||||19||Homicidal||Something REALLY strage happened to the car today! (Help?)||||1||
Z||000000||Homicidal||07-01-2000||11:35 PM||||It ran PERFECT all morning, and when I went to the ATM today, I shut the car off and about 1-2 seconds later turned the key far enough so the radio would stay on for my girlfriend to listen to while I ran to the bank.<P>I did my stuff and when I got back in, it wouldn't start!  Cranked fine, but no catch!  Similiar to a ignition control module defect or if it wasn't getting gas.<P>So I tried a few times and no luck.  I got frustrated and took the key out.  I sat and thought for a few, and then put the key back in once more to try and start it.  <P>It started fine.<P>It's been running perfect again!  What the hell WAS that?  Why did it not start until I took the key out and put it back in again?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Uaana||07-01-2000||11:44 PM||||That it know as the 13yo car gremlin.<BR>Deal with it stuff happens.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fret Naught||07-01-2000||11:47 PM||||If it had happened to me, I would suspect the ignition switch, contacts may be dirty or something. Try getting it to happen again by working and jiggeling the switch, if you can duplicate the problem, then you know it is in the switch. I kept having the same problem with my wife's car, finally I replaced the switch, and got her to take all that extra junk off of her key ring. no more prblem. Just a thought, good luck.||||reg||3
Z||000003||Homicidal||07-01-2000||11:57 PM||||Wouldn't be as confusing if it happened ALL the time, but it just happened that once today!  Never before or after!<P>Also:<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>That it know as the 13yo car gremlin.<BR>                          Deal with it stuff happens.<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm assuming you meant by this:<P>"That is known as the 13 year old car Gremlin.  Deal with it, stuff happens!"<P>Next time, learn the language before typing it!<P>Anyways, stuff does not "just happen".  Something caused it and I was only posting to find out any possible reasons why.  ||||reg||1
